            <creation xml:id="creation_id15777f84">
               <date isodate="1840" xml:id="date_1e270fb4">184?</date>
               <geogName xml:id="geogName_iddf121644"/>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_idfcc1ec8c">
               <p xml:id="idm82">The manor house Cathrineberg in Taastrup belonged to Carl Vilhelm Thalbitzer from 1826, the year he married Elisabeth Brøndsted, until his death in 1867, where after his widow inherited the estate. She died in 1871. His mother Sophia Dorothea Thalbitzer (1774-1851) was the author of the well known memoirs "Grandmamas Bekiendelser" of 1807. Nothing is known about Gade's connection to the Thalbitzer family.</p>
            </history>
